<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<databaseChangeLog
    xmlns="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog"
    xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
    xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog
        http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog/dbchangelog-latest.xsd">

    <!--
        FOR-04-19 (task 8.2, R7.8 / R7.6): idempotent seed of the construction analog-group
        material TYPES referenced by the research artifacts under
        FOR-04-RESEARCH-material-norms but not yet present in CONSTRUCTION_MATERIAL_TYPES.

        Source of truth: the DISTINCT `material_type` values on the `branch = construction`
        rows of work-material-norms.csv (identical to the union of the per-category
        work-material-norms-cat*.csv files) — 83 codes. The downstream construction-materials
        reseed (066) and the consumption seed (069) resolve their `type` / `material_type`
        column against CONSTRUCTION_MATERIAL_TYPES.code by this exact (verbatim, UPPER_SNAKE)
        code string, so the code stored here MUST equal the CSV material_type verbatim.

        The three FOR-04-17 placeholder types seeded by 054 use lowercase codes
        (farba / klej_plytki / grunt) and therefore do NOT collide with any of these
        research codes; all 83 are genuinely absent. Each insert is nonetheless guarded by
        its own <preConditions onFail="MARK_RAN"> + <sqlCheck expectedResult="0"> on the
        type code, so a re-run — or a run against a database where a code already exists —
        inserts nothing (idempotent).

        Registered LAST in changelog.xml, AFTER 064 (units) and BEFORE 066 (construction
        materials) so every analog-group type a construction material resolves to exists.
    -->

    <changeSet id="065-seed-cmt-AKRYL" author="foremen">
        <preConditions onFail="MARK_RAN"><sqlCheck expectedResult="0">SELECT COUNT(*) FROM construction_material_types WHERE code = 'AKRYL'</sqlCheck></preConditions>
        <insert tableName="construction_material_types">
            <column name="code" value="AKRYL"/><column name="name_ru" value="Акрил"/><column name="name_pl" value="Akryl"/><column name="active" valueBoolean="true"/>
        </insert>
    </changeSet>

